        <div class="mb-8">
            <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-brand-gold mb-5"></div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-burgundy leading-tight">The Walled City of Veracruz</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-gray-700 max-w-4xl">Map of Veracruz around 1860, painted by Casimiro Castro. Shows the walled city with its bulwarks, gates, docks, convents, and historic buildings; each number identifies one of these sites.</p>
        </div>

        
        <div class="mb-6 w-full flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-brand-gold/15 border border-brand-gold/40 px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-burgundy">
